umap: a Go implementation of UMAP and densMAP

The algorithms are described by:

- McInnes, Healy, and Melville, "UMAP: Uniform Manifold Approximation and
  Projection for Dimension Reduction" (2018), arXiv:1802.03426.
- Narayan, Berger, and Cho, "Assessing single-cell transcriptomic variability
  through density-preserving data visualization" (2021), Nature Biotechnology.

Compatibility is evaluated against umap-learn, Copyright (c) 2017 Leland
McInnes, John Healy, and James Melville, distributed under the BSD 3-Clause
license. No umap-learn source code is included in this module.
